{"case_id": "VT-R01", "question": "按ViT的patch划分公式，224×224图像与16×16 patch产生多少个patch token？加入class token后序列长多少？", "category": "reasoning", "split": "dev", "reference_answer": "224/16=14；patch数14×14=196，加入一个class token后为197。这是公式计算，不是论文单独测量的实验指标。", "relevant_sources": [{"document_id": "f16b642c2e6a4ff0a7083343fe8cb9cc", "page": 3, "quote": "HW/P"}], "expected_tools": ["knowledge_qa", "calculator"], "reviewed": true, "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true, "inference_basis": "calculation_from_reported_values", "source_provenance": [{"paper_key": "vit", "physical_page": 3, "pdf_sha256": "8ce7b83971a14508ca711a27c875c9b6914c4f6767cf3150fb1ca6c07aa056d6", "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2010.11929v2", "page_text_sha256": "5f9d529f1fee3dfec27bf12163a5be7b3a767e0dbe701bf553ace9ea8b50d419", "check": "Full source page read; short literal anchor verified; answer paraphrased", "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true}], "annotation_note": "AI原文核对，尚待人工复核；document_id已映射实际知识库，原始出处保留在source_provenance。"}
